TI  - [Endobronchial neurofibroma].
PG  - 182-4
AB  - Neurofibroma belongs to the benign tumors and it is categorised as 
      neuroectodermal tumor. Neurofibromas are most frequently found in the posterior 
      mediastinum, their endobronchial localisation is rather rare. Our paper presents 
      two cases of endobronchial neurofibromas with diverse clinical and X-ray 
      symptomatology. Both patients underwent surgery and the etiology of tumours was 
      assessed by histological examination of the preoperative biopsy.
