AB  - Endobronchial metastases from hepatocellular carcinoma are very rare. Up to date, 
      no more than 7 cases were reported. The authors present a case of 20-year old 
      female with metastatic hepatocellular carcinoma to superior lobar bronchus. 
      Examination of cytological and small biopsy specimens obtained from bronchoscopy 
      revealed characteristic microscopic features and immunohistochemical profile of 
      hepatocellular carcinoma.
