LID - 939808
AB  - Endobronchial lipoma is a rare benign tumor. It is difficult to differentiate 
      benign endobronchial lipoma from their malignant counterparts, as their symptoms 
      and complications are almost alike. Here, we describe the clinical and 
      radiological features of EL in two cases. Multislice CT (MSCT) may play an 
      important role in the diagnosis for EL.
