AB  - Endobronchial localization of sclerosing hemangioma is extremely rare. Exact 
      localization of lesion at preoperative work-up allows parenchymal-sparing 
      procedures. We report a case of endobronchial sclerosing hemangioma diagnosed 
      preoperatively and treated by lingular-sparing upper lobectomy with nodal 
      dissection.
