PMID- 12174619
OWN - NLM
STAT- MEDLINE
DCOM- 20020923
LR  - 20061115
IS  - 0021-5252 (Print)
IS  - 0021-5252 (Linking)
VI  - 55
IP  - 9
DP  - 2002 Aug
TI  - [Endobronchial brachytherapy for intra-luminal recurrence after lung cancer 
      resection].
PG  - 758-62
AB  - A 63-year-old man who had squamous cell carcinoma in left lung was received left 
      lower lobectomy with lymph node dissection (pT3N0M0). Twenty months after 
      surgery, the patient showed bloody sputum and bronchofiberscopy revealed 
      intra-luminal recurrence on trachea. Endobronchial brachytherapy in combination 
      with external beam radiotherapy was selected and complete remission was achieved. 
      After the brachytherapy, bronchitis was observed and was healed 23 months after 
      the therapy.
