TI  - A case of pulmonary sarcoidosis, not tuberculosis.
PG  - 562-3
AB  - The case of sarcoidosis of the lungs is described in a 50 years old female who 
      presented with symptoms similar to pulmonary tuberculosis. As she showed no 
      improvement on anti-tubercular therapy, sarcoidosis was suspected and confirmed 
      by endobronchial biopsy and she responded well to treatment.
