AB  - Lung volume reduction with valves is increasingly used to treat selected patients 
      with severe emphysema. The indications for this procedure have been previously 
      described; however, its contraindications have not yet been conclusively 
      established. This case highlights the potentially severe complications of 
      endobronchial one-way valve placement in the setting of a previous pleurodesis.
