TI  - Aneurysmal appearance of medium-sized bronchi: a peripheral manifestation of 
      endobronchial tuberculosis.
PG  - W95-9
LID - 10.2214/AJR.08.1833 [doi]
AB  - OBJECTIVE: The purpose of this study is to show the importance of aneurysmal 
      appearance of medium-sized bronchi observed at CT in the diagnosis of 
      tuberculosis (TB). CONCLUSION: Aneurysmal appearance of medium-sized bronchi is a 
      CT feature of tuberculosis. In TB-endemic areas, the aneurysmal appearance of 
      medium-sized bronchi at CT may suggest the diagnosis of TB.
