TI  - Serum myeloperoxidase in cystic fibrosis patients receiving systemic antibiotics.
PG  - 163-6
AB  - Serial serum myeloperoxidase was determined in 27 cystic fibrosis patients with 
      chronic endobronchial Pseudomonas aeruginosa infection over the course of 1 y. 
      The effect of repeated courses of antibiotic therapy on mean serum 
      myeloperoxidase levels was significant (p = 0.034). Serial serum myeloperoxidase 
      may help to guide therapy for pulmonary exacerbations.
