TI  - [Inflammatory pseudotumor: a rare cause of proximal bronchial obstruction].
PG  - 183-6
AB  - Inflammatory pseudotumor of the lung is a rare disease with usual benign course. 
      Relapse after incomplete resection and aggressive forms have already been 
      described. We report the case of a 67-year-old woman with atelectasis of the left 
      lung related to an endobronchial inflammatory pseudotumor. After laser resection, 
      relapse occurred 3 months later, requiring surgical treatment.
