TI  - An unusual lung mass post stem cell transplantation.
PG  - 672-5
LID - 10.1111/tid.12257 [doi]
AB  - We report a case of Mycobacterium kansasii presenting as an obstructing 
      endobronchial mass in a patient post stem cell transplant. The patient had a 
      complete clinical, microbiological, and radiological response to anti-tuberculous 
      treatment. To our knowledge, this is the first case of M. kansasii presenting 
      post transplant with an obstructing lung mass simulating relapse or 
      post-transplant lymphoma.
